      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُجْسَةٌ</span></b> , with damm, <i>A period</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَاعَةٌ</span>) of the
night. (O, K, TA.) And The <i>blackness</i> of night.
(IAar, TA. [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَجْسٌ</span>.]) And see 5, last
sentence but one, in two places.

